Google Fonts, Material Design 3, Google Icons
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The interface follows:

  - Google Fonts               https://fonts.google.com/
  - Material Design 3          https://m3.material.io/
  - Google Icons               https://fonts.google.com/icons
                               (Material Symbols)

Those works belong to Google LLC. Material Design 3 and Material Symbols
are licensed under the Apache License 2.0.

The served Keydler page loads Roboto and Material Symbols Outlined from
Google Fonts, under the SIL Open Font License 1.1. They are fetched at
runtime, not bundled in this repository. No script is loaded from any CDN.
Material Design 3 itself is followed as a specification, not a dependency.

